// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Admissions Officer Lenk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1362409792" "Admissions Officer Lenk"
// ProfessionString :
"P505407160" "Admissions Officer"
// DescriptionString :
"P925377136" "Greg Lenk was hired on as the Admissions Officer soon after Paragon University, Steel Canyon campus was opened.  He has a Masters degree in Advanced Education.  Greg loves cats."
// ContactRequiresText :
"P2571386039" "You must either be a VIP Subscriber or have an Invention License to interact with this contact."
// HelloString :
"P3872575590" "Welcome back.  How are you enjoying the university?"
// HelloString :
"P1845535518" "Hello again, {HeroName}.  Good to see you!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2267841083" "I'm terribly sorry, but this new curriculum and the flurry of student admissions is taking up too much of my time for me to help you right now. Why don't you check with {LastContactName} for something to do?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4125639584" "Welcome to Paragon University, {HeroName}!  I'm Greg Lenk, the Admissions Officer here on campus. We have just implemented an exciting Invention curriculum.<br><br><font color=deepskyblue>This is the Invention Tutorial.  It should take you approximately 20 minutes to complete.  Click on 'Ask about available missions' to start the tutorial.</font>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1336621577" "I've given you all the information you need about the invention system.  If you need to brush up on the information, go back to your research resources from your classes."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1011550088" "You're a little overloaded right now, {HeroName}.  Manage your time a bit and come back to me when you're done."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1924138632" "I would love to talk to you, but this information is classified beyond your current Security Level. Come back when you're level 10 or higher."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P270833529" "Let's get you started right away.<br><br>If you ever need to, feel free to stop by and check the course syllabus anytime.  I'll just leave them there for you to review."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3958075051" "string"
// LocationString :
"P3493519327" "Steel Canyon"
// IntroString :
"P2163179676" "You should go talk to Admissions Officer Lenk about the Invention curriculum.<br><br>He is located in the Administration area of the university."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2758373360" "I'm glad you taking the time to learn this, {HeroName}."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1450302238" "Greg Lenk should be able to get you started on Inventions at the university, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1789368280" "Time for your first course.  Inventions 101: Salvage."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P722876366" "You should not be seeing this."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


