// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Charles_Ball 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Charles Ball 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3518426795" "Charles Ball"
// ProfessionString :
"P1239739778" "Recipe Instructor"
// DescriptionString :
"P3055349284" "Charles Ball is the Recipe instructor.  None of the faculty or staff can actually remember hiring him.  He's so surly that they've decided not to push it.  He seems to know his stuff about Invention recipes, though."
// ContactRequiresText :
// FirstVisitString :
"P1311489093" "Great.  Another student. <br><br>Fine.  My class is about Recipes.  One word about cooking and I will punch you in the nose.  Close your pie hole, open your ears, and listen up because I am not repeating myself."
// HelloString :
"P1868823534" "And, it's you.  Again.  Yes, this class is still about Recipes.  The stacks are always at your disposal if you ever need a refresher."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2368278704" "Sorry, {VillainName}, you're not on the list.  Get yourself over to Dean Yu to sign up if you're interested in the Inventions program."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3130335464" "Quit standing around, {VillainName}.  Go see {LastContactName}. I told him to expect you.<br><br>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// LocationString :
"P3766049399" "Cap au Diable"
// IntroString :
"P3990862380" "Recipes are the backbone of the Invention system. Without Salvage and Recipes, there is no system. This course is designed to give you an overview of what types of Recipes can be found (or bought), rarities, and what is required to use them.<br><br>Charles Ball is located in the Library."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1874753966" "Link to click on to accept as new contact."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3008387555" "The next class is on Recipes taught by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P34351720" "You barely scraped by, which is better than most.  Go ahead on move on to your next class."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


