// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dean John Yu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P586689022" "Dean John Yu"
// ProfessionString :
"P2103468508" "University Dean"
// DescriptionString :
"P3324232756" "Dean Yu's career at Rogue Isles University is dubious at best.  He rocketed through the ranks of administration like a man on fire, climbing to the top over the backs of his associates.  <br><br>Once he got there, he lost steam.  These days, Dean Yu accepts the paycheck and shuttles students through the system as quickly as he can.  <br><br>No time to waste when there's money to be made."
// ContactRequiresText :
// HelloString :
"P3119619790" "What do you want?"
// HelloString :
"P111884106" "I hope this is important."
// HelloString :
"P2000925242" "Oh.  It's you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2103012227" "You are wasting my time.  Why don't you check with {LastContactName} for something to do?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4164451771" "Well, {VillainName}, I suppose you want to know more about the new Invention Program.  That must be why you're standing there.<br><br><font color=deepskyblue>This is the Invention Tutorial.  It should take you approximately 20 minutes to complete.  Click on 'Ask about available missions' to start the tutorial.</font>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3580843277" "I've already told you what I needed to.  Don't you have anything better to do than loiter here in front of me?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3260488112" "You've clearly got time management issues.  Come back when your schedule is a little less hectic, {VillainName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1368594963" "Come back when you've reached level 10."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3614036797" "Inventions program.  Either you're interested or you aren't.  There are copies of the class list and instructors on the table here."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1196337352" "If you want to know more about the Inventions program, see Dean Yu.  He's mean, but he'll get you started.<br><Br>He is located in the Administration area of the university."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3780962994" "It's about time you expanded your educational horizons, {VillainName}."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P11506434" "See Dean Yu.  He'll be able to get you going on the Invention Program, {VillainName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1967655559" "Alright, so you're in, huh? Then let's get started."
