// Name :
"P3744210348" "James Bright"
// ProfessionString :
"P2253184792" "Lab Instructor"
// DescriptionString :
"P1820904978" "James Bright has come directly to the university from the military.  While he spouts the military jargon like he's a General, he never actually made it past private before he was dishonorably discharged.  He doesn't even have a uniform so he wears the labcoat instead.  He knows his inventions, though.  It's how he survived boot camp."
// ContactRequiresText :
// FirstVisitString :
"P1380300901" "This is not a walk in the park, recruit!  You will listen and you will listen closely!  I am your drill ser--instructor Bright and this class is on Invention Enhancements!"
// HelloString :
"P125536871" "Recruit, you have darkened my boot again.  Are you lost?"
// HelloString :
"P64255749" "Did you miss me, Recruit?  Is it my handsome face that brings you back?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2051221410" "You are not my list, recruit!  You need to join the ranks by speaking to Dean Yu."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1973295893" "You will go see {LastContactName} now, {VillainName}. I have told him to expect you.  Do not let me down!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3570925215" "Invention Enhancements are a new type of Enhancement that does not expire. This course will give the basics of the concept behind this new type of enhancement, how to create them, and their rules.<br><br>James Bright is located on the second floor of the Laboratory."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1140146342" "The next class is on Invention Enhancements taught by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1093141152" "Fine work, soldier!  Fine fine work!"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


