"P3506831335" "Janitor"
// ProfessionString :
"P384941487" "Janitor"
// DescriptionString :
"P331808409" "Sometimes you don't need to be a teacher to know something.  The Janitor is the man when it comes to hooking up students with information.  It's always the quiet ones."
// ContactRequiresText :
// FirstVisitString :
"P681949087" "Sup, {VillainName}?  Nice job on the Inventor thing.  Looks like you got prospects after all.  <br><br>So yeah, I sent for you.  I may just be a janitor, but I've got connections all over the Rogue Isles.  You're gonna wanna know what they are."
// HelloString :
"P1669787968" "You're standing in front of me again.  What?"
// HelloString :
"P542885946" "What?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3364630310" "You don't look like you belong, pal.  You gotta see Dean Yu if you wanna go to school here."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1808064690" "I got nothing for ya, pal.  You already finished all your classes.  You're as done as done can be.  Go make and sell something."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2231703581" "I do not know what the janitor wants.  He must have mistaken you for one of those lollygaggers, not the fine serviceman that you are.  See him and sort it out.  We are done here."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P480450775" "The Janitor has requested your presence."
// IntroduceOneContact :
