"P866669385" "Professor Chandler is one of the foremost scientists in Paragon City.  Though she is not on the faculty full-time, her insight into Engineering (all fields) has proven to be invaluable to the university.  She's one of the most popular instructors on campus.  For some reason most of her students are male.  Professor Chandler originally taught in Scotland."
