// FirstVisitString :
"P4213314827" "{HeroName}, is it?  Ah, grand.  I'm Professor Chandler and this is a two-part class on Workbenches and Results."
// HelloString :
"P3987191105" "Hello, {HeroName}!  Welcome back to the lab!  If you ever need to refresh your memory, go ahead and look at the computer again."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2499114832" "Are you enrolled in the University? I don't see your name in the roll books.  If you're interested in signing up, speak with Admissions Officer Lenk."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1222434401" "You should go see {LastContactName} now, {HeroName}. I was highly complimentary when I gave him your information."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1154444161" "This course is a brief overview of the how Workbenches function as well as all the different kinds of items (not just Enhancements) that you can create using the Workbenches.<br><br>Professor Chandler is located on the first floor of the Laboratory."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2472073058" "The next course is Inventions 301: Workbench & Results taught by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1608585307" "Very good.  It looks like you're almost ready to put all that training to use!"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
