// HelloString :
"P1967464586" "You're back, {HeroName}.  Missed my class, did you?  I figured as much.  Recipes really are the backbone of the entire system.  And no, that cooking class joke still isn't funny."
// HelloString :
"P1592723041" "Welcome back, {HeroName}.  All fired up for some Recipe learning?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2719673014" "Are you enrolled in the University? I don't see your name in the roll books.  If you are interested in enrolling, speak with Admissions Officer Lenk."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1711972275" "You should go see {LastContactName} now, {HeroName}. I told her to expect you.<br><br>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1836322199" "Recipes are the backbone of the Invention system. Without Salvage and Recipes, there is no system. This course is designed to give you an overview of what types of Recipes can be found (or bought), rarities, and what is required to use them.<br><br>Professor Taylor is located in the Library."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2997097216" "The next course is Invention 201: Recipes taught by:"
