// Name :
"P3136029111" "Professor Topffer"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1198748464" "Professor Topffer is a card.  He loves Engineering and spends hours in the Laboratory creating everything from coffee-makers to advanced molecular nanobots.  He was the first faculty member hired at Paragon University.  His passion is evident in everything he does and word around campus is that he's the spitting image of, and loves to quote, Dr. Helmut Brun from <i>The Future is Back</i>."
// ContactRequiresText :
// FirstVisitString :
"P3805719405" "You're late!  Have you no concept of time?  No excuse for tardiness!<br><br>I'm Professor Topffer!  Now come on and let's teach you a little something about Invention Enhancements."
// HelloString :
"P58998122" "Isn't the process of Invention Enhancements FASCINATING!?  I just love them!  Love them!  Anyway, if you ever want any kind of refresher, feel free to look through the manifests over and over.  They're always available for you to review."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1017166714" "Invention Enhancements are a new type of Enhancement that does not expire. This course will give the basics of the concept behind this new type of enhancement, how to create them, and their rules.<br><br>Professor Topffer is located on the second floor of the Laboratory."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P199935705" "The next course is Inventions 401: Invention Enhancements taught by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2958778343" "Well, you've passed my class with flying colors.  It looks like your last stop is the Guidance Counselor."
